  "_comment": "AI radar source catalog, focused on software engineering with AI and agentic coding, with a smaller strategy/regulation section. Editable. Fields: id (unique), name, feed (RSS/Atom; null when the source publishes no feed), site (read via WebFetch, and the fallback when a feed dies), lang (en or pt-BR; also decides the card's language -- pt-BR sources keep their cards in Portuguese), category, weight (1-5; 5 = primary source, almost always relevant). Optional: kind ('release' = a version feed, consolidate a day's releases per tool into one card), topic_filter (true = general source, only items mentioning AI or coding agents get through) and max_items (its own ceiling, lower than the global one). Feeds move: fetch_feeds.py reports the failures so you can fix them here. Validated against the live network on 2026-09-03.",
